  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef has a sequence A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​. He needs to find the number of pairs (i,j)(i, j)(i,j) (1≤i&lt;j≤N1 \\le i \\lt j \\le N1≤i&lt;j≤N) such that Ai+Aj=Ai⋅AjA_i + A_j = A_i \\cdot A_jAi​+Aj​=Ai​⋅Aj​. However, he is busy, so he asks for your help.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤201 \\le T \\le 201≤T≤20",
      "1≤N≤40,0001 \\le N \\le 40,0001≤N≤40,000",
      "0≤Ai≤1090 \\le A_i \\le 10^90≤Ai​≤109 for each valid iii",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (30 points):** 1≤N≤5001 \\le N \\le 5001≤N≤500"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains a single integer NNN.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print a single line containing one integer ― the desired number of pairs.",
    "notes": [],
